WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.049 --> 00:00:04.310
Good morning John. We like to have a pretty
positive attitude here at Vlogbrothers, but once a year,

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:09.610
once a year I like to get furious. For not really
great reasons, but today

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:15.460
is that day this year. John, today, I'm going
to have seventeen rants in four minutes.

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:19.040
This. Whatever - I recognize that it is food;

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:23.019
I don't mind putting it on a sandwich
every once in a while, but Kraft?

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:27.060
Do not call this cheese!

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.240
That is not the texture, the smell, the taste,

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:34.340
or consistency of cheese! Calling it
American cheese

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:39.210
is an insult to both my country and my
second-favorite kind of food!

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.810
Speaking of food, 90% fat free
does not mean that it is

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:47.940
any percent fat free! It means it's
10% fat! It should just say that: "Ten percent fat".

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:50.539
Dear people who complain about the "chemicals"

00:00:50.539 --> 00:00:54.270
that they're exposed to. EVERYTHING IS
CHEMICALS! Water,

00:00:54.270 --> 00:01:00.370
your body, omega-3 fatty acids,
raspberries. Chemicals.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:04.739
Continuing on this theme, stop saying
"all-natural" when you mean "healthy", because

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:08.540
there's lots of all-natural things that...
Like, I don't sit down

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:14.820
and, like, eat a tub of lard while marathoning Firefly!
But that would be "all-natural"!

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:20.500
What the crap is up with this kind of toilet paper?
Like I want to know who the diabolical

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:24.640
turd-face was who decided to promote
the discomfort of all mankind with this

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:29.820
harsh, non-perforated, flimsy... terribleness!

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:34.160
Speaking of public restrooms,
if you pee on the seat, any amount,

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:37.500
CLEAN IT UP YOU
TERRIBLE PERSON. IT'S YOUR PEE!

00:01:37.509 --> 00:01:39.849
And someone is going to have to clean it up,

00:01:39.849 --> 00:01:43.360
but if it's not you, they
will be cleaning up someone else's pee!

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:47.800
People who think that not knowing every
bit of a fandom's trivia makes you not a fan,

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:53.060
well, oh. I guess you were just born
with a deep and intense knowledge of the

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:55.189
backstory of Buffy the Vampire Slayer!

00:01:55.189 --> 00:01:59.380
Were you not, at one time, an excited novice
just like the person you are

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:03.180
currently insulting?! Do you
really need to ruin that for them?!

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.100
Oh, okay, I see you were turning!

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:09.370
Oh, if only there had been some way for you
to signal your intent to do that!

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:11.660
Stop correcting people for saying "GIF" (jif)

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:16.330
or "GIF" (gif) wrong, they are both correct
pronunciations. By telling someone

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:21.150
they are doing it wrong, you are the only
person who is wrong!

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:25.800
Freaking ketchup, there's so much ketchup at the bottom.

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:28.000
And I know what you're saying –
you're saying, "Hank, why don't you just

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.099
get the squeezable kind?" Yeah, that's perfect
if I want to spray some

00:02:31.099 --> 00:02:33.839
pink ketchup piss all over my fries!

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:35.780
[Tries to sneeze]

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:36.500
COME ON!!!

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.500
Manufactures of chair wheels everywhere.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:43.250
I should have got this ready before.
I've got the chair on my lap.

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:46.770
Freaking knots!
Freaking... why are they always in knots?!

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:50.239
Can you please make it so that this doesn't fit

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:54.980
in this? Because this...
IS THE WORST THING!!! AHHHHHH!!!

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:58.200
If you're still using "gay" as an insult, it's not just

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:02.060
really insulting to gay people, it also
makes you sound really

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.020
immature and kind of stupid. So stop!

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:09.700
And finally, to all the people who are going to
complain about me complaining in this

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.290
video, because we all have it so good!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:16.220
Yes. I recognize that I am a wealthy person,

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:21.440
in the wealthiest country, at the
wealthiest moment so far in human history!

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:25.600
But nonetheless, somehow, it still hurts when I stub my
toe, and I'm still annoyed

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.720
when the freaking checkout thing asks me for

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:32.319
the tenth time if I have scanned my club card!
[Machine]: Have you scanned your club card?

00:03:32.319 --> 00:03:36.690
No. I haven't scanned my club card. You know
how I know? Because you're still asking

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:40.990
me, you passive aggressive
robot sack of ketchup pee. GAH!

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.220
Final note at the end of this video.
A lot of people have told me that it's good to get

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:45.739
out your anger every once in a while, but
I've read research that in fact,

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:50.690
the angrier you are, the more angry you
become. So this, actually, is a bad idea.

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:54.569
Don't do the thing I just did, because now my heart rate's all up, and I just want to enrage about everything.

00:03:54.569 --> 00:03:57.260
[Panting]
I'll see you on Tuesday, John!

